---
layout: base.njk
title: "Updates"
description: "Everything shipped on Elixir MCP, newest first: what changed, and why it matters to players and their agents."
permalink: /updates/index.html
canonical: /updates
navActive: updates
---
{#-
  What changed, newest first, with a rail that filters by kind and jumps
  by month. The kind is derived from the entry (a version in the title
  is a contract change; a retirement says so), never typed twice. With
  JavaScript off every entry shows and the month links still jump.
-#}
{%- set months = updatesView | byMonth %}
{%- set shipped = updatesView | ofKind("shipped") %}
{%- set contract = updatesView | ofKind("contract") %}
{%- set retired = updatesView | ofKind("retired") %}
<div class="siterail">
  <aside class="siterail__nav" data-siterail data-open="false" data-updates-rail>
    <button type="button" class="siterail__head" data-rail-toggle aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="updates-rail">
      <span class="siterail__head-title">Updates</span>
      <span class="siterail__head-here" data-updates-here>Everything</span>
      <span class="siterail__head-meta">{{ updatesView.length }}<span class="siterail__head-chevron">{% icon "chevron-down", 17 %}</span></span>
    </button>
    <nav class="siterail__list" id="updates-rail" aria-label="Updates">
    <div class="rail__group">By kind</div>
    <button type="button" class="rail__item rail__item--on" data-kind="all" aria-pressed="true">{% icon "list", 18 %}Everything <span class="rail__meta">{{ updatesView.length }}</span></button>
    {#- A kind with nothing in it is not offered: a filter that empties
        the page is a dead end, not a choice. -#}
    {%- if shipped.length %}
    <button type="button" class="rail__item" data-kind="shipped" aria-pressed="false">{% icon "check-check", 18 %}Shipped <span class="rail__meta">{{ shipped.length }}</span></button>
    {%- endif %}
    {%- if contract.length %}
    <button type="button" class="rail__item" data-kind="contract" aria-pressed="false">{% icon "file-code", 18 %}Contract <span class="rail__meta">{{ contract.length }}</span></button>
    {%- endif %}
    {%- if retired.length %}
    <button type="button" class="rail__item" data-kind="retired" aria-pressed="false">{% icon "archive", 18 %}Retired <span class="rail__meta">{{ retired.length }}</span></button>
    {%- endif %}
    <div class="rail__group">Archive</div>
    {%- for m in months %}
    <a class="rail__item" href="#{{ m.key }}">{% icon "calendar-days", 18 %}{{ m.label }} <span class="rail__meta">{{ m.items.length }}</span></a>
    {%- endfor %}
    </nav>
    <div class="siterail__foot">
      <a class="btn btn--sm" href="/feed.xml" title="Subscribe to Elixir MCP updates">{% icon "rss", 14 %}Subscribe</a>
      <a class="btn btn--sm" href="/data/changelog">{% icon "file-text", 14 %}Contract changelog</a>
    </div>
  </aside>

  <div class="siterail__body">
    <h1 class="hero-title" style="margin-bottom: 6px" data-updates-title>Updates</h1>
    <p class="lede" style="margin: 0 0 22px; max-width: 60ch">
      What changed, newest first. Contract changes carry a version — the full
      <a href="/data/changelog">changelog</a> has every one.
    </p>

    {%- for m in months %}
    <h2 id="{{ m.key }}" class="label" style="margin: 26px 0 12px">{{ m.label }}</h2>
    {%- for u in m.items %}
    <article class="panel" style="margin-bottom: var(--s-4)" data-kind="{{ u.kind }}">
      <div class="panel__head" style="flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 11px">
        <span class="chip {% if u.kind == 'shipped' %}chip--ok{% elif u.kind == 'contract' %}chip--info{% else %}chip--warn{% endif %}">{{ u.kind }}</span>
        <span class="panel-title">{{ u.title }}</span>
        <span style="margin-left: auto; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px">
          {%- if u.version %}
          <span class="mono" style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink-body); border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); border-radius: 6px; padding: 2px 7px">{{ u.version }}</span>
          {%- endif %}
          <time class="mono" style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink-faint)" datetime="{{ u.date }}">{{ u.date }}</time>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="panel__body"><p style="color: var(--ink-body); margin: 0; line-height: 1.65; text-wrap: pretty">{{ u.body }}</p></div>
      {%- if u.link %}
      <div style="padding: 0 18px 14px"><a class="btn btn--sm" href="{{ u.link }}">In the changelog →</a></div>
      {%- endif %}
    </article>
    {%- endfor %}
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</div>

<script defer src="/assets/updates-filter.js"></script>
<script defer src="/assets/site-rail.js"></script>
